A real quick announcement for all of our clients who have been patiently waiting for a non-recourse program that was not only affordable, but would also close! 

Memphis Invest has partnered with a company out of Southern California named First Line Mortgage.  They are not a mainstream lender, but prefer instead to work with select clients whom they can tailor their services for.

We have been very diligent in working with First Line since the Spring of this year and would like to invite you to see for yourself how well this program works for investors wanting to invest inside and outside of their SDIRA.

Several of our clients have begun to finance purchases and even refinance properties already owned in their SDIRA.  By refinancing properties held in an SDIRA, investors have been able to double and in some cases triple the number of properties in their portfolios and grow not only the return, but also their net worth.  For long-term capital building, this is a fantastic strategy.

First line has been able to tailor fit a program where investors are able to invest less than 50% of purchase price, amortize the property over 15 years and secure a private mortgage at under 10%.  These terms allow investors to use non-recourse leverage AND maintain a positive cash flow on the properties.

We would love to speak with you one-on-one on the details of this program and help you determine if it fits your over-all wealth building goals. Many of you have been reaching out to us over the year looking for this exact type of solution to keep growing your portfolio.

Don't hesitate to contact us over the holidays!  We will be working and absolutely available to discuss the details.

Have a safe and wonderful holiday season and a happy new year!


